  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia - Papua New Guinea Network (Phase 4)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australia-Papua New Guinea Network plays an important role in expanding people-to-people links between Australia and Papua New Guinea and fosters partnerships between business, civil society, communities and academia. Together these links help build knowledge of and support for the Australia-Papua New Guinea relationship, which benefits other Australian interests in Papua New Guinea, including other development investments. Phase Four continues the building and fostering of people-to-people links between young leaders of Australia and Papua New Guinea, particularly through the annual Emerging Leaders Dialogue. The Phase Four thematic focus aligns with Australian events, strategic messaging and public diplomacy products marking Papua New Guinea&#x2019;s 50th Anniversary of Independence, which the Australia-Papua New Guinea Network is well-placed to deliver.</narrative>
  </description>
